      "side": 1,
      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] **Test Oracle Integrity:** These boolean assertions form a weak oracle that only verifies specific bits while ignoring the rest of the register\u0027s state. To ensure `cros_flash_init` doesn\u0027t accidentally set or corrupt other bits, assert the exact expected post-state of the registers.\n\n```c\n\t/* SRP bits are cleared and non-protection bits must survive the status register rewrite. */\n\tzassert_equal(sr1, SPI_FLASH_SR1_WEL);\n\tzassert_equal(sr2, SPI_FLASH_SR2_QE);\n```\n[🔗](http://go/tj/b796b5c2-47f2-48d8-b2ae-7038c5c312a6)",
